## Description

This detection identifies the execution of Windows account enumeration commands using **net.exe** or **net1.exe**.

Threat actors frequently enumerate local user accounts after gaining access to a system in order to identify privileged users, service accounts, or potential targets for credential theft and lateral movement.

Monitoring account enumeration commands provides defenders with early visibility into post-compromise reconnaissance activity.

